'''NVAImportBot''' is a bot operated by [[User:Ajarmund|Ajarmund]]. It adds missing, referenced data from
[https://nva.sikt.no Nasjonalt vitenarkiv] (NVA, the Norwegian national research archive, successor of Cristin)
to Wikidata.

